    "explanation": "<p>$\\mathrm{k}=2$ হলে প্রদত্ত সমীকরণ, $4 \\mathrm{x}^2-2 \\mathrm{x}+1=0$</p><p>(i) পৃথায়ক $=(-2)^2-4 \\times 4 \\times 1=4-16=-12$</p><p>(ii) $4 x^2-2 x+1=0$ </p><p>$\\therefore x=\\frac{-(-2) \\pm \\sqrt{-12}}{2 \\times 4}$ [(i) নং হতে] </p><p>$=\\frac{2 \\pm \\sqrt{-4 \\times 3}}{8}=\\frac{2 \\pm 2 i \\sqrt{3}}{8}=\\frac{1}{4} \\pm i \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}$ </p><p>$\\therefore$ মূলদ্বয়ের গুণফল $=\\left(\\frac{1}{4}+i \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{4}-i \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\right)$ </p><p>$=\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^2-\\left(i \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\right)^2=\\frac{1}{16}+\\frac{3}{16}=\\frac{1+3}{16}=\\frac{4}{16}=\\frac{1}{4}$ </p><p>(iii) একটি মূল $\\frac{1}{4}+i \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}$ বা, $\\frac{1}{4}-i \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}$</p><p><br></p><p>সঠিক উত্তর (ii).</p><p>যদি $k=4$ হয়, (i) পৃথায়ক $=(-4)^2-4 \\times 4 \\times 1=0$</p><p>(ii) $4 x^2-4 x+1=0$</p><p>বা, $(2 x)^2-2 \\cdot 2 x \\cdot 1+(1)^2=0$ বা, $(2 x-1)^2=0$</p><p>$\\therefore x=\\frac{1}{2}, \\frac{1}{2}$ মূলদ্বয়ের গুণফল $=\\frac{1}{4}$</p><p>$\\therefore$ (iii) একটি মূল $\\frac{1}{2} \\therefore$ (i), (ii), (iii) সঠিক।</p>"
